// ==WindhawkMod==
// @id              steam-custom-tray-icon
// @name            Steam Custom Tray Icon
// @description     Replaces Steam's tray icon with an included icon or a custom .ico file
// @version         1.2.0
// @author          RafaMrPotato
// @github          Rafamrpotato
// @include         steam.exe
// @compilerOptions -lshell32 -luser32
// ==/WindhawkMod==

// ==WindhawkModReadme==
/*
Replaces the Steam notification-area icon.

The included ICO is temporarily extracted, loaded by the Windows icon loader,
and deleted immediately. No permanent icon file is left behind.

Icon source options:
- Included icon: Uses the icon embedded in this mod.
- Custom icon file: Loads an external .ico file.
- Steam original: Leaves Steam's original icon unchanged.

For a custom icon, use a full path such as:
C:\Users\YourName\Documents\Icons\steam.ico

Important:
Windhawk can exclude programs inside game folders by default. If the mod doesn't
load in steam.exe, add the exact steam.exe path to Windhawk's process inclusion
list. Do not include the entire Steam folder.
*/
// ==/WindhawkModReadme==

// ==WindhawkModSettings==
/*
- iconSource: included
  $name: Icon source
  $description: Choose the included icon, a custom ICO file, or Steam's original icon.
  $options:
  - included: Included icon
  - custom: Custom icon file
  - original: Steam original
- customIconPath: ""
  $name: Custom icon path
  $description: Full path to an .ico file. Used only when Icon source is Custom icon file.
*/
// ==/WindhawkModSettings==

